---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Button, Dialog, TextField } from "astro-ink";
---
<Base title="Dialog">
  <div class="docs-page">
    <h1>Dialog</h1>
    <p class="docs-lede">
      Modal task window. Focus is trapped inside, Escape closes, and focus
      returns to the trigger.
    </p>

    <h2>Example</h2>
    <div class="docs-example">
      <Button data-ink-dialog="#demo">Invite member</Button>
      <Dialog id="demo" label="Invite member">
        <TextField id="invite-email" label="Email" type="email" placeholder="teammate@example.com" />
        <Button type="button">Send invite</Button>
      </Dialog>
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;Button data-ink-dialog="#demo"&gt;Invite member&lt;/Button&gt;
&lt;Dialog id="demo" label="Invite member"&gt;
  &lt;TextField id="invite-email" label="Email" /&gt;
  &lt;Button type="button"&gt;Send invite&lt;/Button&gt;
&lt;/Dialog&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Sizes</h2>
    <p>Pass <code>size="sm" | "md" | "lg"</code>. ConfirmDialog locks to <code>sm</code>.</p>

    <h2>Events</h2>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>document.addEventListener("ink:dialog:open", (event) =&gt; &#123;
  console.log(event.target.id);
&#125;);</code></pre>

    <h2>Props</h2>
    <table class="docs-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Targeted by <code>data-ink-dialog="#id"</code> triggers.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>label</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Dialog landmark name.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>size</code></td><td><code>sm | md | lg</code></td><td><code>md</code></td><td>Panel width.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <ul class="docs-list">
      <li><code>role="dialog"</code> + <code>aria-modal</code> + focus trap via the shared helper.</li>
      <li>Escape and backdrop click close; body scroll locks while open.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
